verge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"2160\" data-pswp-width=\"3840\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The</em> <em>Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max</em>.\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p></div><p><strong>1<!-- -->/<!-- -->3</strong><span><figcaption><em>The</em> <em>Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max</em>.</figcaption> <cite>Image: Anker</cite></span></p></section><p>As built-in edgers crop up in robot mower models from <a href=\"https://navimow.com/products/navimow-x4-robot-lawn-mower?variant=45014269100169&utm_source=google&utm_medium=paid_buy&utm_campaign=%7Bcampaignname%7D&utm_term=&utm_content=%7Bcreativeid%7D&campaign_id=23902044226&adgroup_id=&creative_id=%7Bcreativeid%7D&gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=23897587388&gbraid=0AAAABCbHRtspCUijoMHFVt8A3ePhpiW7_&gclid=Cj0KCQjw79nUBhCgARIsADSHka3ZW-oNZ8Ow_xcav9A-Ush97hk0vD7G5GJyTOAkh_uT44h5fdpruAgaAu3KEALw_wcB\">Segway</a>, <a href=\"https://www.anrdoezrs.net/links/8836598/type/dlg/https://www.ecovacs.com/us/shop/goat-robotic-lawn-mower/goat-o1000-lidar-pro?utm_source=google&utm_medium=pmax&utm_campaign=pmax_x12&gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=23983808045&gbraid=0AAAAAobxNdfvydFqlmaDPbLrEYLQoSDFV&gclid=Cj0KCQjw79nUBhCgARIsADSHka32XKJlIstxHu6Q7tkFALd8tmHbTyqYFL2ePDvTOiff-dsq91sqYXsaAiVIEALw_wcB\" rel=\"sponsored\">Ecovacs</a>, <a href=\"https://garden.roborock.com/us/products/roborock-rockmow-x1\">Roborock</a>, and now Anker, even Mammotion is jumping on the bandwagon with the newly announced Luba 4 AWD, which uses an edge-cutting attachment to trim against walls, fences, and garden borders.</p><p>The Mammotion Luba 4 AWD roves your yard using four cameras on the front, sides, and rear of the device, along with a 360-degree lidar system and network RTK, which taps into the cloud for navigation. Mammotion says the three-sensor system helps to ensure “zero dead zones and zero drift.” Additionally, the Luba 4 AWD comes with independent front-wheel steering, helping the mower change directions without U-turns that might leave tracks on your yard.</p><section tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"carousel\"><div id=\":R3cbcprar96:\"><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"8000\" data-pswp-width=\"8000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em>\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcS