9/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"8000\" data-pswp-width=\"8000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em>\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p></div><p><strong>1<!-- -->/<!-- -->5</strong><span><figcaption><em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em></figcaption> <cite>Image: Mammotion</cite></span></p></section><p>The Luba 4 AWD is available in three models, with the 3000F cutting up to 0.75 acres and the 6000F handling up to 1.5 acres. The 12000F is designed to cut up to 3 acres, but it doesn’t support the edge-trimming attachment. The dual-disc system on the 3000F and 6000F models supports a wider 17.3-inch cutting width, while the three cutting discs on the 12000F span 20.9 inches. Mammotion plans to open preorders for the Luba 4 AWD later this year, but it hasn’t shared details on pricing yet.</p><div><p><span><strong>Follow topics and authors</strong> from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.</span></p><ul><li id=\"follow-author-article_footer-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6MTE2\"><span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span><span>Emma Roth</span></span></span></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div></div></DIV>","content_text":"Anker’s new robot lawn mower might take over for your Weedwacker, too. Announced at IFA 2026, the Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max comes with an extendable trimming arm to clean up the grass around your driveway and flowerbeds.The dual-blade mower offers vSLAM navigation that uses built-in cameras to build a 3D map of your yard, eliminating the need to set up boundary wires or a real-time kinematic (RTK) base station. Anker says the Mower S2 Max can map and mow up to 3.7 acres, while handling yards with up to 80 percent (38-degree) slopes. The robot mower is AWD and will launch in May 2027 for €3,999. There’s no word on US pricing or availability yet.1/3The Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max. Image: AnkerAs built-in edgers crop up in robot mower models from Segway, Ecovacs, Roborock, and now Anker, even Mammotion is jumping on the bandwagon with the newly announced Luba 4 AWD, which uses an edge-cutting attachment to trim against walls, fences, and garden borders.The Mammotion Luba 4 AWD roves your yard using four cameras on the front, sides, and rear of the device, along with a 360-degree lidar system and network RTK, which taps into the cloud for navigation. Mammotion says the three-sensor system helps to ensure “zero dead zones and zero drift.” Additionally, the Luba 4 AWD comes with independent front-wheel steering, helping the mower change directions without U-turns that might leave tracks on your yard.1/5The Luba 4 AWD. Image: MammotionThe Luba 4 AWD is available in three models, with the 3000F cutting up to 0.75 acres and the 6000F handling up to 1.5 acres. The 12000F is designed to cut up to 3 acres, but it doesn’t support the edge-trimming attachment. The dual-disc system on the 3000F and 6000F models supports a wider 17.3-inch cutting width, while the three cutting discs on the 12000F span 20.9 inches. Mammotion plans to open preorders for the Luba 4 AWD later this year, but it hasn’t shared details on pricing yet.Follow topics and authors from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.Emma Roth","fetched_at":"2026-09-04T12:07:02.415Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>Anker’s new robot lawn mower might take over for your Weedwacker, too. Announced at IFA 2026, the Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max comes with an extendable trimming arm to clean up the grass around your driveway and flowerbeds.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Anker’s new robot lawn mower might take over for your Weedwacker, too.","zh":null},{"en":"Announced at IFA 2026, the Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max comes with an extendable trimming arm to clean up the grass around your driveway and flowerbeds.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>The dual-blade mower offers vSLAM navigation that uses built-in cameras to build a 3D map of your yard, eliminating the need to set up boundary wires or a real-time kinematic (RTK) base station. Anker says the Mower S2 Max can map and mow up to 3.7 acres, while handling yards with up to 80 percent (38-degree) slopes. The robot mower is AWD and will launch in May 2027 for €3,999. There’s no word on US pricing or availability yet.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The dual-blade mower offers vSLAM navigation that uses built-in cameras to build a 3D map of your yard, eliminating the need to set up boundary wires or a real-time kinematic (RTK) base station.","zh":null},{"en":"Anker says the Mower S2 Max can map and mow up to 3.7 acres, while handling yards with up to 80 percent (38-degree) slopes.","zh":null},{"en":"The robot mower is AWD and will launch in May 2027 for €3,999.","zh":null},{"en":"There’s no word on US pricing or availability yet.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><strong>1<!-- -->/<!-- -->3</strong><span><figcaption><em>The</em> <em>Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max</em>.</figcaption> <cite>Image: Anker</cite></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"1/3The Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max.","zh":null},{"en":"Image: Anker","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<figcaption><em>The</em> <em>Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max</em>.</figcaption>","sentences":[{"en":"The Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>As built-in edgers crop up in robot mower models from <a href=\"https://navimow.com/products/navimow-x4-robot-lawn-mower?variant=45014269100169&utm_source=google&utm_medium=paid_buy&utm_campaign=%7Bcampaignname%7D&utm_term=&utm_content=%7Bcreativeid%7D&campaign_id=23902044226&adgroup_id=&creative_id=%7Bcreativeid%7D&gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=23897587388&gbraid=0AAAABCbHRtspCUijoMHFVt8A3ePhpiW7_&gclid=Cj0KCQjw79nUBhCgARIsADSHka3ZW-oNZ8Ow_xcav9A-Ush97hk0vD7G5GJyTOAkh_uT44h5fdpruAgaAu3KEALw_wcB\">Segway</a>, <a href=\"https://www.anrdoezrs.net/links/8836598/type/dlg/https://www.ecovacs.com/us/shop/goat-robotic-lawn-mower/goat-o1000-lidar-pro?utm_source=google&utm_medium=pmax&utm_campaign=pmax_x12&gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=23983808045&gbraid=0AAAAAobxNdfvydFqlmaDPbLrEYLQoSDFV&gclid=Cj0KCQjw79nUBhCgARIsADSHka32XKJlIstxHu6Q7tkFALd8tmHbTyqYFL2ePDvTOiff-dsq91sqYXsaAiVIEALw_wcB\" rel=\"sponsored\">Ecovacs</a>, <a href=\"https://garden.roborock.com/us/products/roborock-rockmow-x1\">Roborock</a>, and now Anker, even Mammotion is jumping on the bandwagon with the newly announced Luba 4 AWD, which uses an edge-cutting attachment to trim against walls, fences, and garden borders.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"As built-in edgers crop up in robot mower models from Segway, Ecovacs, Roborock, and now Anker, even Mammotion is jumping on the bandwagon with the newly announced Luba 4 AWD, which uses an edge-cutting attachment to trim against walls, fences, and garden borders.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>The Mammotion Luba 4 AWD roves your yard using four cameras on the front, sides, and rear of the device, along with a 360-degree lidar system and network RTK, which taps into the cloud for navigation. Mammotion says the three-sensor system helps to ensure “zero dead zones and zero drift.” Additionally, the Luba 4 AWD comes with independent front-wheel steering, helping the mower change directions without U-turns that might leave tracks on your yard.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The Mammotion Luba 4 AWD roves your yard using four cameras on the front, sides, and rear of the device, along with a 360-degree lidar system and network RTK, which taps into the cloud for navigation.","zh":null},{"en":"Mammotion says the three-sensor system helps to ensure “zero dead zones and zero drift.”","zh":null},{"en":"Additionally, the Luba 4 AWD comes with independent front-wheel steering, helping the mower change directions without U-turns that might leave tracks on your yard.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><strong>1<!-- -->/<!-- -->5</strong><span><figcaption><em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em></figcaption> <cite>Image: Mammotion</cite></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"1/5The Luba 4 AWD.","zh":null},{"en":"Image: Mammotion","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<figcaption><em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em></figcaption>","sentences":[{"en":"The Luba 4 AWD.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>The Luba 4 AWD is available in three models, with the 3000F cutting up to 0.75 acres and the 6000F handling up to 1.5 acres. The 12000F is designed to cut up to 3 acres, but it doesn’t support the edge-trimming attachment. The dual-disc system on the 3000F and 6000F models supports a wider 17.3-inch cutting width, while the three cutting discs on the 12000F span 20.9 inches. Mammotion plans to open preorders for the Luba 4 AWD later this year, but it hasn’t shared details on pricing yet.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The Luba 4 AWD is available in three models, with the 3000F cutting up to 0.75 acres and the 6000F handling up to 1.5 acres.","zh":null},{"en":"The 12000F is designed to cut up to 3 acres, but it doesn’t support the edge-trimming attachment.","zh":null},{"en":"The dual-disc system on the 3000F and 6000F models supports a wider 17.3-inch cutting width, while the three cutting discs on the 12000F span 20.9 inches.","zh":null},{"en":"Mammotion plans to open preorders for the Luba 4 AWD later this year, but it hasn’t shared details on pricing yet.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span><strong>Follow topics and authors</strong> from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Follow topics and authors from this story to see more like this in your personalized homepage feed and to receive email updates.","zh":"关注此故事中的主题和作者，以在您的个性化主页源中查看更多类似内容并接收电子邮件更新。"}]},{"html_en":"<li id=\"follow-author-article_footer-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6MTE2\"><span aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span><span><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 9 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Follow\"><path d=\"M5 0H4V4H0V5H4V9H5V5H9V4H5V0Z\" /></svg></span><span>Emma Roth</span></span></span></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Emma Roth","zh":"艾玛·罗斯"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"zephr-anchor\"><p>Anker’s new robot lawn mower might take over for your Weedwacker, too. Announced at IFA 2026, the Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max comes with an extendable trimming arm to clean up the grass around your driveway and flowerbeds.</p><p>The dual-blade mower offers vSLAM navigation that uses built-in cameras to build a 3D map of your yard, eliminating the need to set up boundary wires or a real-time kinematic (RTK) base station. Anker says the Mower S2 Max can map and mow up to 3.7 acres, while handling yards with up to 80 percent (38-degree) slopes. The robot mower is AWD and will launch in May 2027 for €3,999. There’s no word on US pricing or availability yet.</p><section tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"carousel\"><div id=\":R36bcprar96:\"><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2-Max-Mower-on-grass.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"1416\" data-pswp-width=\"1212\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The</em> <em>Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max</em>.\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2-Max-Mower-on-grass.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2-Max-Mower-on-grass.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2-Max-Mower-on-grass.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2-Max-Mower-on-grass.jpg?qual