ng?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"2160\" data-pswp-width=\"3840\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The</em> <em>Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max</em>.\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/S2Max-2.png?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p></div><p>1/3The Eufy Robot Lawn Mower S2 Max. Image: Anker</p></section><p>As built-in edgers crop up in robot mower models from Segway, Ecovacs, Roborock, and now Anker, even Mammotion is jumping on the bandwagon with the newly announced Luba 4 AWD, which uses an edge-cutting attachment to trim against walls, fences, and garden borders.</p><p>The Mammotion Luba 4 AWD roves your yard using four cameras on the front, sides, and rear of the device, along with a 360-degree lidar system and network RTK, which taps into the cloud for navigation. Mammotion says the three-sensor system helps to ensure “zero dead zones and zero drift.” Additionally, the Luba 4 AWD comes with independent front-wheel steering, helping the mower change directions without U-turns that might leave tracks on your yard.</p><section tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"carousel\"><div id=\":R3cbcprar96:\"><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"8000\" data-pswp-width=\"8000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em>\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Left-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"8000\" data-pswp-width=\"8000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em>\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Cutting-system.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/upload