oads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Front-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"8000\" data-pswp-width=\"8000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em>\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Right-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all\" data-pswp-height=\"8000\" data-pswp-width=\"8000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"<em>The Luba 4 AWD.</em>\" data-chromatic=\"ignore\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 744px\" srcSet=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=376 376w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=384 384w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=415 415w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=480 480w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=540 540w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=640 640w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=750 750w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=828 828w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1080 1080w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1200 1200w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1440 1440w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=1920 1920w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2048 2048w, https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400 2400w\" src=\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/Top-View.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&w=2400\"></a></p></div><p>1/5The Luba 4 AWD. Image: Mammotion</p></section><p>The Luba 4 AWD is available in three models, with the 3000F cutting up to 0.75 acres and the 6000F handling up to 1.5 acres. The 12000F is designed to cut up to 3 acres, but it doesn’t support the edge-trimming attachment. The dual-disc system on the 3000F and 6000F models supports a wider 17.3-inch cutting width, while the three cutting discs on the 12000F span 20.9 inches. Mammotion plans to open preorders for the Luba 4 AWD later this year, but it hasn’t shared details on pricing yet.</p><div><p>关注此故事中的主题和作者，以在您的个性化主页源中查看更多类似内容并接收电子邮件更新。</p><ul><li id=\"follow-author-article_footer-dmcyOmF1dGhvclByb2ZpbGU6MTE2\">艾玛·罗斯</li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></div></div></div>"}